; Klatt's duration rules 2 to 7. Nine cards a segment in (kind, wf, liq, after, fs, pf, bef, s, nextk); out, the
; factors that apply to it, in hundredths, then 0. Rule 2: phrase-final (pf) 140. Rule 3: a vowel not phrase-final
; 60; a phrase-final consonant after the vowel that is L R M N or NX (liq) 140. Rule 4: a vowel not in its word's
; last syllable (fs 0) 85. Rule 5: a vowel in a word with more vowels (bef or after) 80. Rule 6: a consonant not
; first in its word (wf 0) 85. Rule 7, for a segment not stressed 1: a vowel 50 if vowels of its word come before
; and after it, else 70; a sonorant before a vowel 10; anything else 70.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-18: a segment; a pause has no factors
  04                    INP   wf
  05                    INP   liq
  06                    INP   after
  07                    INP   fs
  08                    INP   pf
  09                    INP   bef
  10                    INP   s
  11                    INP   nextk
  12                    CLA   kind
  13                    SUB   c8
  14                    TAC   sound
  15                    JMP   end
  16            sound   CLA   kind
  17                    SUB   n2
  18                    TAC   syl
  19                    CLA   pf       19-32: a consonant: rules 2, 3 and 6
  20                    SUB   00
  21                    TAC   c6
  22                    OUT   c140
